              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "عن طريق الخطأ (ʿan ṭarīq al-khaṭaʾ) is \"by way of the mistake\": khaṭaʾ is built on the native Arabic root kh-ṭ-ʾ, \"to miss the mark\" (Lane), the root of the taught khaṭaʾ."
