              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "سأزور تلك المدينة يوما ما. sa-azūru tilka al-madīna yawman mā. I will visit that city someday."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Of the future; ذات يوم opens a story in the past."
